        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ref: 9251\n\nExcellent C. 0.6 Acre Site For Sale by Private Treaty (Subject to Planning Permission)\n\nThe subject property is located 1.7km off the R742, the main Kilmuckridge/Blackwater road (opposite Blackwater Golf Club). It is 5km from Blackwater village with hotel, bar, supermarket etc, 5km from Kilmuckridge and all its amenities in a popular tourist location. \n\nThe site containing c. 0.6 acres is registered in Folio Number WX21861 and is being sold subject to planning permission and local needs will apply. \n\nDirections: From Kilmuckridge head south on the R742 for 2km, turn right and continue for 1.4km and take a left at sign for Blackwater Golf course, site is on the right marked with a QUINN PROPERTY sign. \n"
      },
